  | getResourcePolicy
  /-- Imports table data from an S3 bucket. -/
  | importTable
  /-- List DynamoDB backups that are associated with an Amazon Web Services account and weren't made with Amazon Web Services Backup. -/
  | listBackups
  /-- Lists bulk operations that started within the past 90 days for the current Amazon Web Services account and Amazon Web Services Region, with the most recent operations first. -/
